Description: audio player with playlists, LED meters, spectrum analyser and media keys
 Sonora is an Audacious-style audio player built with Qt 6 and GStreamer.
 Features: any number of playlists with artist/album/year/time/type columns
 and metadata tooltips, per-playlist filter, LED level meters, a configurable
 spectrum analyser, selectable sound service (PipeWire, PulseAudio, ALSA,
 JACK, ...) and output device, dark mode, and MPRIS2 support so that the
 keyboard's dedicated media keys work.
